  (text "R1 = R2 = 10k with C1 22n / C2 10n: f = 1073 Hz, Q = 0.742." (at 78.74 41.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9b4363eb-9902-5ffb-b558-b8b1fb5a91e0"))
  (text "Butterworth wants Q = 0.707 = 11 nF - not a C0G value, and" (at 78.74 45.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6b3af823-9711-5dfe-8492-1f1eda939f7f"))
  (text "C0G is what keeps the corner where it is; an X7R of this" (at 78.74 49.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b6a413bf-cb44-5687-8c35-dff852ac9bb3"))
  (text "size loses a third of its value over the rail." (at 78.74 53.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "573f0625-75b2-5769-910d-5fc9fb1e78f7"))
  (text "VREF is half the rail: R3/R4 make it, U2 buffers it. The" (at 95.25 186.69 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1cc1b11c-e30e-593f-9fff-4639d23415e0"))
  (text "filter's return flows into that node through C2; a bare" (at 95.25 190.69 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ba2ee0f8-3be3-542d-9758-bb74c2a8ebe2"))
  (text "divider is a 50k source - the filter would not be this filter." (at 95.25 194.69 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "39b2e17b-adab-52e0-af7e-f78e64ecfd72"))
  (text "C3/C6 couple in and out: the header sees no DC." (at 15.24 137.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3728b114-9382-5d81-94fe-323b79dd4463"))
  (text "R5 sets the input's operating point at VREF;" (at 15.24 141.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c65f4123-8158-5951-93be-c0d2ec1e4f71"))
  (text "R7/R6 bleed the coupling caps so nothing pops." (at 15.24 145.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "dd271667-0e57-5e49-8562-0ee013e1c891"))
  (text "TP1-TP3: filter input, output and VREF -" (at 127.0 60.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c9909505-649c-54c4-bddb-35c19ed5ba05"))
  (text "where the simulation meets the board." (at 127.0 64.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "df67024b-4042-5168-adb9-f45d85367bc1"))
  (sheet_instances
    (path "/" (page "1"))
  )
